  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEPSEA is a regional network that seeks to strengthen capacity in the area of poverty, economic development and environmental change by     strengthen the ability of researchers in Southeast Asia to undertake  policy relevant research, support the growth of rigorous              policy-relevant literature, support teaching/research insitutions and by  facilitate dialoge among economist and others on environment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EEPSEA &#xe4;r ett regionalt forskningsn&#xe4;tverk som str&#xe4;var efter att       st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten f&#xf6;r forskning som r&#xf6;r fattigdom, ekonomisk         utveckling och milj&#xf6;. Syftet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka sydostasiatiska forskares  f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att bedriva policy-relevant forskning, st&#xe4;rka framv&#xe4;xten av   rigor&#xf6;s policy-relevant literatur, st&#xf6;dja undervisnings- och          forskningsinstitutioner, samt underl&#xe4;tta dialogen mellen ekonomer och</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved design and implementation of policies and programs towards sustainable environmental and natural resource management.</narrative>
  </description>
